            "Adhesive, primer, solvent, SDS, ventilation, and ignition controls verified",
            "Knee, lifting, handling, ergonomic, and repetitive-work controls addressed",
            "Blades, saws, grinders, cords, GFCI, guards, and PPE controlled",
            "Occupied-area separation, egress, trip, access, and signage maintained",
            "Temperature, humidity, odor, cure, and reentry restrictions communicated",
